ized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4946545389","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121202#issuecomment-4946545389","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121202","id":4946545389,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJtZK7Q","user":{"login":"Goldenlion5648","id":32916571,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTE2NTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32916571?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648","html_url":"https://github.com/Goldenlion5648","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldenlion5648/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-11T14:08:48Z","updated_at":"2026-07-11T14:10:46Z","body":"Apologies, this is for hyprland specifically (I'm on Omarchy). Fixed above\r\n\r\n> This is handy when I have ~5 Godot instances/ versions open.\r\n\r\n> What's the usecase for that? \r\n\r\nWhen switching between project windows, it can helpful to know which project I just switched to.\r\n\r\n> Not people toying around with 100 unfinished projects (no offense ment by the way, I belong to the latter).\r\n\r\nEven when just copying some parts from other projects on the same version, showing the project name helps track which is which\r\n\r\nMade a proposal here: https://github.com/godotengin